  "label": "Misogynous Stereotype",
  "description": "The meme relies on a misogynistic stereotype that dehumanizes women by comparing them to chickens, implying they are to be controlled and ultimately killed. This stereotype is rooted in real-world misogynistic attitudes that objectify women as property or commodities, reducing their value to their utility or perceived subservience. The metaphor is a form of verbal violence that reinforces harmful gender norms.",
